BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:LWV Speaker Series - Where Do We Go from Here?: The Environmental 
 Impact of Data Centers
DTSTART:20261118T190000
DTEND:20261118T203000
DTSTAMP:20261118T192640Z
UID:22dc207e8a17ed335eb3efe3ced86f@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:The talk will focus on the use and environmental release of PF
 AS forever chemicals and explain why all data center proposals should be s
 ubject to complete environmental reviews. Lenny Siegel has worked for deca
 des on environmental issues surrounding the tech industry and has served o
 n numerous regional and national environmental advisory groups\, including
  committees of the the National Academies of Sciences. This will be a virt
 ual presentation. Questions may be submitted through Chat\, or in advance 
 to sue@lwvofvt.org To attend this talk go to: https://bit.ly/AIDataCntr.\n
 \nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Kellogg Hubbard Library\, 135 Main Street
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/lwv-speake
 r-series-where-do-we-go-from-here-the-environmental-impact-of-data-centers
 -29-10-2026-14-04-59
END:VEVENT
